      "message": "docs(project): mark v66 project compatibility as breaking\n\nRecord the incompatible project format in release metadata and preserve\nthe existing reviewed commit history.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Project format advances from v65 to v66 to preserve\nAC trunnion machine fields and explicit non-RTCP capability. v65 and older\nreaders refuse v66 project files.\n\nRefs #1962",
